tices recommended vaccination with updated COVID-19 vaccines for all persons aged ≥6 months.\"}]}, {\"v\": \"review or synthesis\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The Work Group conducted a systematic review of benefits and harms of vaccination\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"GRADE is used to assess the confidence (high, moderate, low, or very low) that the true effect lies close to that of the estimated effect.\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Among adolescents and adults, benefits of bivalent vaccination were assessed using pooled observational VE data for three outcomes\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"GRADE is used to assess the confidence (high, moderate, low, or very low) that the true effect lies close to that of the estimated effect.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Severe reactogenicity occurred more often in the vaccine than placebo study arms, and the certainty assessment for the clinical trial body of evidence was low\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"data_focus\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}